    <section class="century-section century-proof-section" id="proof">
      <header class="century-section-header">
        <div>
          <span>02 / PROOF OF LEARNING</span>
          <h2 class="i18n-zh">真正的成果不是更多内容，而是判断如何被改写</h2>
          <h2 class="i18n-en">The proof is not more content. It is how judgments were rewritten.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="i18n-zh">三个研究回放展示同一套机构能力：提出问题、保存分歧、连接产业与股票、等待后续证据，并公开修订。</p>
        <p class="i18n-en">Three replays show the same institutional capability: ask, preserve dissent, map industries and stocks, await evidence, and revise in public.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="century-flagship-grid">
        {flagshipReplays.map((replay) => (
          <article class={`century-flagship tone-${replay.color}`}>
            <header><span>{replay.code}</span><i></i></header>
