            </button>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="century-flow-inspector" id="centuryFlowInspector">
          <span>01 / SIGNAL</span>
          <strong class="i18n-zh">信号进入研究议程</strong><strong class="i18n-en">Signals enter the research agenda</strong>
          <p class="i18n-zh">市场变化、研究缺口和既有 thesis 的证伪条件决定下一步由谁研究，而不是让模型随机生成内容。</p>
          <p class="i18n-en">Market changes, evidence gaps, and thesis falsifiers determine what is researched next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="century-section century-operating-section" id="operating-proof">
      <header class="century-section-header">
        <div>
          <span>07 / OPERATING PROOF</span>
          <h2 class="i18n-zh">一座研究机构，不只要会研究，还要知道自己何时没有产生价值</h2>
          <h2 class="i18n-en">A research institution must know not only how to research, but when it produced no value.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="century-operating-intro">
          <p class="i18n-zh">{operatingProof.provenanceZh}</p>
          <p class="i18n-en">{operatingProof.provenanceEn}</p>
          <time datetime={operatingProof.reviewDate}>EVIDENCE REVIEW · {operatingProof.reviewDate}</time>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="century-proof-legend" aria-label="Operating proof status legend">
        {Object.entries(operatingProof.statuses).map(([key, status]) => (
          <span class={`tone-${status.color}`} data-proof-status={key}>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <strong class="i18n-zh">{status.labelZh}</strong>
            <strong class="i18n-en">{status.labelEn}</strong>
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="century-layer-boundary" aria-label="Research scheduling execution and publication boundary">
        <div class="tone-blue">
          <span>WHAT / WHEN</span>
          <strong>AI INSTITUTE</strong>
          <p class="i18n-zh">决定研究什么、何时运行，并提交执行意图。</p>
          <p class="i18n-en">Decides what to research, when to run, and submits execution intent.</p>
        </div>
        <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
        <div class="tone-red">
          <span>HOW</span>
          <strong>AGENT ROUTE</strong>
          <p class="i18n-zh">负责排队、路由、执行、产物与恢复。</p>
          <p class="i18n-en">Owns queues, routing, execution, artifacts, and recovery.</p>
        </div>
        <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
        <div class="tone-green">
          <span>FOR WHOM</span>
          <strong>VIBE</strong>
          <p class="i18n-zh">把脱敏研究重组为人类可检查的判断。</p>
          <p class="i18n-en">Recomposes sanitized research into inspectable human judgment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="century-operating-layers">
        {operatingProof.layers.map((layer) => (
          <article class={`century-operating-layer tone-${layer.color}`} id={`operating-${layer.id}`}>
            <header>
              <span>{layer.code}</span>
              <h3 class="i18n-zh">{layer.titleZh}</h3>
              <h3 class="i18n-en">{layer.titleEn}</h3>
              <p class="i18n-zh">{layer.roleZh}</p>
              <p class="i18n-en">{layer.roleEn}</p>
            </header>
            <div class="century-proof-rows">
              {layer.milestones.map((milestone, index) => {
                const status = operatingProof.statuses[milestone.status];
                return (
                  <details open={index === 0}>
                    <summary>
                      <time datetime={milestone.date.slice(0, 10)}>{milestone.date}</time>
                      <i class={`tone-${status.color}`} aria-hidden="true"></i>
                      <strong class="i18n-zh">{milestone.titleZh}</strong>
                      <strong class="i18n-en">{milestone.titleEn}</strong>
                      <em class={`tone-${status.color}`}>
                        <span class="i18n-zh">{status.labelZh}</span>
                        <span class="i18n-en">{status.labelEn}</span>
                      </em>
                      <b aria-hidden="true">+</b>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="century-proof-detail">
                      <div>
                        <span class="i18n-zh">可证明</span><span class="i18n-en">What is supported</span>
                        <p class="i18n-zh">{milestone.proofZh}</p><p class="i18n-en">{milestone.proofEn}</p>
                      </div>
                      <div>
                        <span class="i18n-zh">诚实边界</span><span class="i18n-en">Honest limit</span>
                        <p class="i18n-zh">{milestone.limitZh}</p><p class="i18n-en">{milestone.limitEn}</p>
                      </div>
                      <div>
                        <span class="i18n-zh">如何推翻</span><span class="i18n-en">What would refute it</span>
                        <p class="i18n-zh">{milestone.refuteZh}</p><p class="i18n-en">{milestone.refuteEn}</p>
                      </div>
                      <a href={milestone.href}><span class="i18n-zh">查看公开证据</span><span class="i18n-en">Open public evidence</span> ↗</a>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                );
              })}
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="century-failure-replay" id="failure-replay">
        <header>
          <span>INCIDENT REPLAY / EMPTY ≠ SUCCESS</span>
          <h3 class="i18n-zh">{operatingProof.failureReplay.titleZh}</h3>
          <h3 class="i18n-en">{operatingProof.failureReplay.titleEn}</h3>
          <p class="i18n-zh">{operatingProof.failureReplay.summaryZh}</p>
          <p class="i18n-en">{operatingProof.failureReplay.summaryEn}</p>
        </header>
        <ol>
          {operatingProof.failureReplay.steps.map((step) => (
            <li class={`tone-${step.color}`}>
              <span>{step.code}</span>
              <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <strong class="i18n-zh">{step.titleZh}</strong><strong class="i18n-en">{step.titleEn}</strong>
              <p class="i18n-zh">{step.bodyZh}</p><p class="i18n-en">{step.bodyEn}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="century-operating-handbook" id="operating-handbook">
        <header>
          <span>OPERATING HANDBOOK / ADOPT + REJECT + TEST</span>
          <h3 class="i18n-zh">{operatingProof.handbook.titleZh}</h3>
          <h3 class="i18n-en">{operatingProof.handbook.titleEn}</h3>
          <p class="i18n-zh">{operatingProof.handbook.summaryZh}</p>
          <p class="i18n-en">{operatingProof.handbook.summaryEn}</p>
        </header>
        <div class="century-practice-grid">
          {operatingProof.handbook.practices.map((practice) => (
            <article class={`tone-${practice.color}`}>
              <div>
                <span>{practice.code}</span>
                <em>{practice.scope}</em>
              </div>
              <h4 class="i18n-zh">{practice.titleZh}</h4>
              <h4 class="i18n-en">{practice.titleEn}</h4>
              <p class="i18n-zh">{practice.bodyZh}</p>
              <p class="i18n-en">{practice.bodyEn}</p>
              <dl>
                <div>
                  <dt>REJECT</dt>
                  <dd class="i18n-zh">{practice.rejectZh}</dd>
                  <dd class="i18n-en">{practice.rejectEn}</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt>TEST</dt>
                  <dd class="i18n-zh">{practice.testZh}</dd>
                  <dd class="i18n-en">{practice.testEn}</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="century-human-role">
        <span>HUMAN ROLE / OUTSIDE-SYSTEM SENSOR</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="i18n-zh">{operatingProof.humanRole.titleZh}</h3>
          <h3 class="i18n-en">{operatingProof.humanRole.titleEn}</h3>
          <p class="i18n-zh">{operatingProof.humanRole.bodyZh}</p>
          <p class="i18n-en">{operatingProof.humanRole.bodyEn}</p>
          <small class="i18n-zh">{operatingProof.humanRole.footnoteZh}</small>
          <small class="i18n-en">{operatingProof.humanRole.footnoteEn}</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="century-day101-contract" id="day101-contract">
        <header>
          <span>DAY 101 / MEASUREMENT CONTRACT</span>
          <h3 class="i18n-zh">下一阶段不再问“还可以加什么”，而问“什么结果会推翻我们”</h3>
          <h3 class="i18n-en">The next phase asks not what else to add, but what outcome would prove us wrong.</h3>
        </header>
        <ol>
          {operatingProof.day101.map((priority) => (
            <li class={`tone-${priority.color}`}>
              <span>{priority.code}</span>
              <h4 class="i18n-zh">{priority.titleZh}</h4>
              <h4 class="i18n-en">{priority.titleEn}</h4>
              <div>
                <strong>MEASURE</strong>
                <p class="i18n-zh">{priority.metricZh}</p>
                <p class="i18n-en">{priority.metricEn}</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>REFUTE</strong>
                <p class="i18n-zh">{priority.refuteZh}</p>
                <p class="i18n-en">{priority.refuteEn}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="century-nonclaims">
        <header>
          <span>WHAT 100 DAYS DO NOT PROVE</span>
          <h3 class="i18n-zh">把不能证明的部分也放进品牌承诺</h3>
          <h3 class="i18n-en">Put what cannot be proven inside the brand promise.</h3>
        </header>
        <div>
          {operatingProof.limits.map((limit) => (
            <article>
              <span>{limit.code}</span>
              <strong class="i18n-zh">{limit.titleZh}</strong><strong class="i18n-en">{limit.titleEn}</strong>
              <p class="i18n-zh">{limit.bodyZh}</p><p class="i18n-en">{limit.bodyEn}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="century-section century-scorecard-section" id="scorecard">
      <header class="century-section-header">
        <div>
          <span>08 / PUBLIC SCORECARD</span>
          <h2 class="i18n-zh">规模、结构、可读性与复盘</h2>
          <h2 class="i18n-en">Scale, structure, readability, and recap</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="i18n-zh">以下只展示当前公开数据能够证明的指标。尚未形成可靠口径的质量指标不会被伪造成完成率。</p>
        <p class="i18n-en">Only metrics supported by current public contracts are shown. Unmeasured quality is not presented as a fabricated completion rate.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="century-score-grid">
        {scoreItems.map((item) => (
          <a class={`century-score-row tone-${item.color}`} href={item.href}>
            <span>{item.label}</span>
            <strong>{number.format(data.scorecard[item.key] || 0)}</strong>
            <em>{item.labelZh}</em>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="century-quality-ledger">
        <div>
          <span>DAY 101 / MEASUREMENT</span>
          <h3 class="i18n-zh">下一阶段应测量什么</h3><h3 class="i18n-en">What the next phase should measure</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li class="i18n-zh">引用覆盖率与来源质量</li><li class="i18n-en">Citation coverage and source quality</li>
          <li class="i18n-zh">QA 通过、修订与失败比例</li><li class="i18n-en">QA pass, revision, and failure rates</li>
          <li class="i18n-zh">Thesis 强化、削弱与证伪比例</li><li class="i18n-en">Thesis strengthening, weakening, and falsification</li>
          <li class="i18n-zh">从研究生成到人类可读交付的时间</li><li class="i18n-en">Time from research generation to a reader deliverable</li>
          <li class="i18n-zh">完整样本的市场表现与决策价值</li><li class="i18n-en">Full-sample market outcomes and decision value</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="century-live-section" id="live">
      <div>
        <span>DAY 100 IS A SNAPSHOT / THE INSTITUTE CONTINUES</span>
        <h2 class="i18n-zh">快照会冻结，研究不会停止。</h2>
        <h2 class="i18n-en">The snapshot will freeze. The research will not.</h2>
        <p class="i18n-zh">继续进入实时晨会、周度全景、thesis、赛道、股票、组合、复盘和研究网络。</p>
        <p class="i18n-en">Continue into live briefs, weekly panorama, theses, lanes, stocks, portfolios, recaps, and the research network.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="century-live-actions">
        <a class="century-primary-action" href="/investor/"><span>↗</span><span class="i18n-zh">进入实时研究院</span><span class="i18n-en">Enter the live Institute</span></a>
        <a href={data.methodologyHref}><span>◎</span><span class="i18n-zh">阅读机构方法</span><span class="i18n-en">Read the methodology</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script type="application/json" id="hundredDaysPayload" set:html={payload}></script>
</div>

